  "description": "Bang Mo-A, an influencer addicted to social media and driven by a life of ease, finds herself captivated by Lee Dan, a lonely, hipster(?) top art student.\n\n *\"Am I too ordinary to handle your art world? Then I just need to break free from the ordinary!\"* \n\nHer efforts to win her crush send her life spiraling in an unexpected direction...? Is it possible to achieve both self-actualization and love? \n\nThis campus romantic comedy depicts the twenties and thirties of a man and a woman with polar opposite personalities.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
